 {"shape": 7, "name": "text2", "link": 50, "label": "文本2", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "CR Text Concatenate", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyroll", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text Concatenate", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [5465.45703125, -1157.5645751953125], "widgets_values": ["‌1. Core Character Design‌\n\n‌Appearance‌: A 25-year-old celestial beauty with skin resembling mutton-fat jade, subtly translucent. Facial features include a defined yet soft bone structure, slightly prominent cheekbones, a straight nose bridge, and full petal-shaped lips in natural pink‌.\n‌Expression‌: Almond-shaped eyes with amber-colored irises, long curled lashes, and a gaze blending mystery and detachment. A faint smile with regal composure‌.\n‌Physique‌: 175cm height, swan-like neck, 58cm waist, legs with natural muscle definition, avoiding artificial retouching‌.\n‌2. Costume Details‌\n\n‌Main Dress‌:\n‌Material‌: Outer layer of sheer silk organza, inner lining of matte satin to eliminate plastic shine‌.\n‌Structure‌: Cross-collared robe with 0.5cm gold-threaded borders. A jade-green brocade belt (3cm wide) ties at the waist, attached with two 2-meter ribbons embroidered with miniature landscapes‌.\n‌Embellishments‌: Graduated cyan-to-emerald skirt with 3D phoenix patterns in silver thread. 999 freshwater pearls (1mm each) adorning phoenix tail feathers‌.\n‌3. Accessories‌\n\n‌Headpieces‌:\nSilver filigree hairpin with 9 South Sea pearls (8mm center pearl above the forehead)‌.\nGold-and-kingfisher-feather butterfly hairpins on temples, wings trembling with movement‌.\n‌Jewelry‌:\n18K gold earrings with icy jadeite drops (length reaching jawline), containing natural inclusions‌.\nChoker necklace of 0.3mm gold filigree in lotus motifs, centered with a 5-carat Paraíba tourmaline‌.\n‌Shoes‌:\nSculpted clear quartz shoes (7cm spiral heels), lambskin-lined, anti-slip engraved soles, and 18K gold cloisonné lotus at toes‌.\n‌4. Scene & Photography‌\n\n‌Environment‌:\nMarble platform extending over clouds, wisteria vines cascading from edges‌.\nDistant karst mountains with pine forests and waterfalls flowing into bioluminescent lotus ponds‌.\nFloating peach-blossom petals and a leaf-shaped guqin with multicolored tassels in foreground‌.\n‌Lighting & Techniques‌:\nGolden-hour backlighting (3200K), softbox at 45° left (60% intensity), reflector on right. Apply 0.5-stop graduated ND filter to mountains‌.\nDepth of field: f/2.8 aperture, focus on eyes, 15% foreground petal blur, 80% background mountain blur‌"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "TextInput_", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-mixlab-nodes", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "b2bb1876def6330fccf1e03cc69d2166cae7bedb", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "TextInput_", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [20], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [315, 106], "pos": [7958.7158203125, -360.678955078125], "id": 27, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.39", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [], "size": [140, 246], "pos": [7900, -190], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 35, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "f